				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人生を　荒波に　たとえるのも
陳腐だが　おはん　流されるなよ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-30T09:48:01" />
